{
  "_comment": [
    "Maps a Tabletop Simulator card object to a marvelsdb card code, for the objects",
    "the automatic cascade in build_assets.py cannot resolve on its own.",
    "",
    "The key is 'Nickname@Bag / Path', with a '#n' ordinal when one bag holds several",
    "different cards under one name. The key survives a re-scan of the art: a rescanned",
    "sheet gets a new content-addressed URL, so keying on the sheet cell would orphan",
    "every entry the moment the art is updated. The cost is that a card renamed upstream",
    "orphans its entry instead, which the script reports rather than ignores.",
    "",
    "A value of null means 'this object is deliberately not a marvelsdb card' -- tokens,",
    "trackers, reference cards and other table furniture that has art but no card record.",
    "",
    "Unresolved objects are written to .cache/unmatched.json with their candidates and a",
    "path to the cropped image, so a new one can be judged by looking at it."
  ],

